# Lychee link checker ignore list
# https://lychee.cli.rs/

# Rate-limited or requires authentication
https://www.linkedin.com/.*
https://twitter.com/.*
https://x.com/.*

# Localhost and local development
http://localhost.*
http://127.0.0.1.*

# Known to block automated requests
https://www.google.com/.*
https://docs.google.com/.*

# Dynamic pages that may not resolve in CI
https://smith.langchain.com/
https://cloud.llamaindex.ai/

# Shield badges
https://img.shields.io/.*
